  "comments": "<p>Norman Washington Manley was a Jamaican statesman who served as the first and only Premier of Jamaica.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In 2000 a Brilliant Uncirculated set was issued to commemorate the 40th Anniversary of The Bank of Jamaica.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6584b85813980.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6584b85813980.jpg\"></a><br>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Two design types present:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Type 1: Thin lettered text; sharp edged inner rim</p><p>1994-2002</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Type 2: Bold lettered text; beveled inner rim</p><p>2014-2022</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/675114d0e2203.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/675114d0e2203.jpg\"></a></p>",
